            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Mi madre se emociona con las bodas. My mother gets emotional at weddings."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Reflexive: me emociono, te emocionas. It is about being touched, not about being angry."
            }
