          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "emocionarse is built on emoción, which came from French émotion (EtymDB); the French word goes back to Latin ēmovēre \"to move out, to stir up\", from movēre \"to move\"."
            }
          ]
        },
